Sources:
- un-secretariat-expenses.csv: https://open.un.org/un-secretariat-financials/expenses?tab=second Note that UN Secretariat expenses include double counting and the total does thus not match with the UN System expenses entry for the Secretariat.
- Global-Indicator-Framework-after-2025-review-English.xlsx: https://unsceb.org/expenses-sdg

Versioned portal taxonomies:
- sdgs.json: SDG numbers and official short/full titles. Official display colours remain in the website code.
- organization-taxonomies.json: system and regional groupings, contributor categories/statuses, and financing-instrument labels.
- secretariat-taxonomies.json: priority areas, budget parts, cost classes, funding sources, budget-unit explanations, and peacekeeping mission names.
- secretariat-entities.json: Secretariat/SPM/PKO/other classifications and field-mission locations.

The frontend imports these files directly. Python exporters load and validate shared taxonomy data through python/domain_taxonomies.py.
